808-2 QUALIFIED ALIENS

A qualified alien is defined as someone who, at the time of application is:

1. A lawful permanent resident;

2. An alien who is a Cuban and Haitian entrant as defined in 501(e) of the Refugee Education Assistance Act of 1980;

3. A Compact of Free Association (COFA) migrant.

